00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,981
The signs decide your marks, so learn them now.

2
00:00:02,981 --> 00:00:06,640
Q is positive when heat is absorbed by the gas.

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:10,820
W is positive when the gas expands and does work.

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,453
And delta U is positive when the temperature rises.

